ECDSAValidator::isValidSignature
├── given the account has installed a signer
│   ├── when the signature is a valid [r,s,v] pack from that signer
│   │   └── it should return true
│   ├── when the signature is from a different (wrong) signer
│   │   └── it should return false
│   └── when the signature is over a different digest
│       └── it should return false
└── given the account has no installed signer
    └── when any signature is checked
        └── it should return false
